<ContentPage title="Contact" eyebrow="Controlled enquiry path" intro="The new public enquiry path will be enabled only when real server-side transport and delivery handling are implemented." noindex={true}>
<section class="content-section"><div class="shell content-grid"><div><h2>No fake successful submission.</h2></div><div class="content-copy"><p>The legacy source could display success without transmitting an enquiry. WEB-01F does not carry that behaviour forward.</p><p>Use <a href="/start-with-your-challenge">Start with your challenge</a> to review the planned Stage-1 boundary. Live contact transport remains WEB-01G scope.</p></div></div></section>
</ContentPage>
